@startuml SEQ_04_LOGOUT
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12\nskinparam TitleFontSize 14
title Sequence Diagram — SEQ-04: Logout

actor       "Pengguna"                       as Pengguna
boundary    "Browser"                        as Browser
control     "AuthenticatedSessionController" as Controller

== Logout ==

Pengguna -> Browser    : Klik tombol Logout
Browser  -> Controller : POST /logout
Controller --> Browser : redirect ke halaman Login
Browser  --> Pengguna  : Kembali ke halaman Login

@enduml
